abstract: >
  An open learning resource for actuarial data science, covering an end-to-end
  problem solving process with data science techniques to tackle various data
  problems in a business context. Topics include generalised linear models,
  machine learning, model selection, and responsible AI.
keywords:
  - actuarial data science
  - machine learning
  - generalised linear models
  - model selection
  - responsible AI
  - open learning resource
